d":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7gdo3w","user":{"login":"matheusmdx","id":44306054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MzA2MDU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44306054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx","html_url":"https://github.com/matheusmdx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matheusmdx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-18T23:21:15Z","updated_at":"2026-01-18T23:21:15Z","body":"Bisected to commit 28619e26cf35227c3ddab35878e1045f82895657 from PR #94169. CC @RandomShaper.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3765865968/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3846666971","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115069#issuecomment-3846666971","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115069","id":3846666971,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7lR3rb","user":{"login":"Jules5","id":10790444,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzkwNDQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10790444?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5","html_url":"https://github.com/Jules5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-04T10:41:22Z","updated_at":"2026-02-04T10:47:16Z","body":"Hi @RandomShaper! \n\nI investigated on my side, to learn how the engine is working under the hood. From my understanding, the issue starts when taking this path in resource_loader.cpp. (I tried to bypass the deadlock prevention mechanism and the issue is gone, so I confirm this is the faulty path).\n<img width=\"1075\" height=\"505\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8d7409b0-51c9-40a3-a2e7-8672beafb6b1\" />\n\nAfter this point we have two tasks for the same resource to load, and in the end either the loaded packed scene is pointing to an uncomplete Tileset (for instance missing the source image) or we crash trying to access the Tileset on the main thread while its still loading on a load thread. I guess the \"restart\" logic is not working as expected?\n\nWe are starting a second load task for the tileset because another thread already launched one before, and we can't wait for this task since it's older to prevent deadlock. Do we need to improve the deadlock prevention logic to avoid starting the same task again? I also though that maybe the external resource loading could be rewritten to not wait for the resource to be loaded but instead register to the task so the resource ref is automatically set by the task itself when the loading is done. If I'm correct we would completely avoid deadlock (and maybe have better performance).\n\nI'd love to have your insight on this 😃 ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3846666971/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3863858308","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115069#issuecomment-3863858308","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115069","id":3863858308,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mTcyE","user":{"login":"Jules5","id":10790444,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzkwNDQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10790444?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5","html_url":"https://github.com/Jules5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jules5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-07T07:20:42Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T19:38:57Z","body":"In the end it was because of a Tile set quirk that led to an unsafe write. I fixed it in the linked PR.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments